# repowise — index & caches are machine-local artifacts (regenerable via
# `repowise update --provider codex_cli --yes`). Config, data exports, and
# generated reports live in .sc/repowise/ and docs/repowise/ (committed).
# sc-compose parity: sc-compose/.gitignore:41-56
.repowise/wiki.db
.repowise/lancedb/
.repowise/jobs/
.repowise/sessions/
.repowise/episodes/
.repowise/state.json
.repowise/.update.log
.repowise/*.pkl
